{"recordId":"emperor_魏孝明帝_259104772","name":"魏孝明帝","type":"emperor","dynasty":"南北朝","title":"北魏孝明帝","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"魏孝明帝","pageId":301566,"revisionId":91065021,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-01-11T04:45:45Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AD%8F%E5%AD%9D%E6%98%8E%E5%B8%9D","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91065021","wikidataId":"Q1071618","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"《文化安丰》","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"Cite book","author":"贾振林编著","publisher":"大象出版社","date":"2011年11月","isbn":"978-7-5347-6898-9","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"魏书·卷六十三·列传第五十一","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北史·卷四十二·列传第三十","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"魏书·卷九十四·列传阉官第八十二","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北史·卷九十二·列传第八十","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"文化安丰","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"魏书·卷十三·列传第一","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"魏书·卷十二·帝纪第十二","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北史·卷五·魏本纪第五","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"魏书·食货志","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"資治通鑑/卷152","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%B3%87%E6%B2%BB%E9%80%9A%E9%91%91%2F%E5%8D%B7152","origin":"literal-wikitext-link","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:05.169Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:zhoushu","source:weishu","source:beishi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-c5a9eaf03d630f3f","query":"魏孝明帝","count":1,"offset":414,"excerpt":"京兆郡三原縣條云：「後周置建忠郡。」但郡實是北魏末建。北史卷四九毛遐附弟鴻賓傳說魏孝明帝因為鴻賓兄弟鎮壓關中武裝軍和反抗蕭寶夤的叛變有「功」，「改三原縣為建中郡」，字作「中」。但太平寰宇記卷三一耀州三原縣條引周地圖記卻作「忠」。周書卷一六獨孤信傳見","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-9b932d8ee67e82fd","query":"魏孝明帝","count":1,"offset":6268,"excerpt":"不俟駕』，此之謂矣。」榮與天穆相顧良久，曰：「卿此言，真丈夫之志也。」\n\n未幾而魏孝明帝暴崩，榮疑有故，乃舉兵赴洛。配岳甲卒二千為先驅，至河陰。榮既殺害朝士，時齊神武為榮軍都督，勸榮稱帝，左右多欲同之，榮疑未決。岳乃從容進而言曰：「將軍首舉義兵，共","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-8c02e1d6c7a39914","query":"魏孝明帝","count":1,"offset":1515,"excerpt":"」原作「聖」。張森楷云：「『聖』當作『正』，『度』下當更有一『拔』字。」按正光是魏孝明帝年號，張説是，今逕改。賀拔度拔事見巻一四賀拔勝傳。這裏是雙名單稱，不是脱文。〕由是知名。以北邊喪亂，避地中山，爲葛榮所獲。信既少年，好自修飾，服章有殊於衆，軍中","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-3a1655d600f98d76","query":"魏孝明帝","count":1,"offset":5721,"excerpt":"曰：「裴長寬兄弟，天倫篤睦，人之師表。吾愛之重之。汝可與之遊處。」年十三，以選為魏孝明帝挽郎，釋褐員外散騎侍郎。魏孝武末，除廣陵王府直兵參軍，加寧朔將軍、員外散騎常侍。及孝武西遷，寬謂其諸弟曰：「權臣擅命，乘輿播越，戰爭方始，當何所依？」諸弟咸不能","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-ca6084b8bf98a51e","query":"魏孝明帝","count":1,"offset":5679,"excerpt":"鼓瑟　宋本、南本及北史卷七０檀翥傳「瑟」作「琴」。〕早為琅邪王誦所知。年十九，為魏孝明帝挽郎。其後司州牧、城陽王元徽以翥為從事，非其好也。尋謝病，客遊三輔。時毛〔（遯）〕〔遐〕為行臺，鎮北雍州，〔時毛〔（遯）〕〔遐〕為行臺鎮北雍州　北史檀翥傳「遯」","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:weishu-7ec5b4ef45e574f6","query":"魏孝明帝","count":1,"offset":1703,"excerpt":"本「由」作「田」。溫校：「『田』當作『由』。《元和志》〔卷二隴州〕南由縣下：『後魏孝明帝於縣西南由谷口〔溫引脫「口」字〕置。』隋志〔卷二九扶風郡〕亦作『南由』。」水經注卷一七渭水篇上「逕南由縣南」。楊疏：「朱謀瑋『由』誤作『田』，全同，趙、戴改作『","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:beishi-f88f37fdb12f579d","query":"魏孝明帝","count":1,"offset":11583,"excerpt":"曰：「裴長寬兄弟，天倫篤睦，人之師表，吾愛之重之，汝可與之遊處。」年十三，以選為魏孝明帝挽郎，釋褐員外散騎侍郎。\n\n及孝武西遷，寬謂其諸弟曰：「君臣逆順，大義昭然。今天子西幸，理無東面以虧臣節。」乃將家屬避難于大石嶺。獨孤信鎮洛陽，始出見焉。時汾州","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":7,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:zhoushu-c5a9eaf03d630f3f","bookId":"book:zhoushu","requestedTitle":"周書/卷02","title":"周書/卷02","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B702","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2432557","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B702?action=history","revisionId":2432557,"revisionTimestamp":"2024-07-05T14:25:30Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:48:01.924Z","sha256":"752fd8a40e84ddb6deb291a4fca1147237392ca2d9f3a682d4dc9dd52c7c317b","textSha256":"811d68b5ff0464006c3a2b505fc98c0b1610b7529596fb0816b4b94224264cdb","expandedWikitextSha256":"752fd8a40e84ddb6deb291a4fca1147237392ca2d9f3a682d4dc9dd52c7c317b","characters":10839,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/zhoushu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.382Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/793bc8c0253531161c3d.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/793bc8c0253531161c3d.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:zhoushu-9b932d8ee67e82fd","bookId":"book:zhoushu","requestedTitle":"周書/卷14","title":"周書/卷14","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B714","revi